          "value": "Matrix([-2,4,4])"
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "text": "(6, −6, 2)",
          "value": "Matrix([6,-6,2])"
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "text": "(−8, −5, 3)",
          "value": "Matrix([-8,-5,3])"
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "text": "(−2, −4, 4)",
          "value": "Matrix([-2,-4,4])"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "solution": "Add matching components. Subtraction, elementwise multiplication, and dropping the sign of 5 give the other options.",
